		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παρᾱγ-</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀγορεύω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>consoling, soothing</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μῦθοι</span>”
