			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> c. gen.,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. δίψης καὶ λιμοῦ</span>
